  <!-- EN: armor-piercing tracer -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>穿甲曳光彈</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Uranium-cored tracer rounds for direct hits. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>鈾芯曳光彈，用於直接命中。</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>
  <!-- EN: airburst -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>空爆彈</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Time-fused rounds that burst just short of the target and spray fragments over an area. Weak against armor. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>定時引信彈，在目標前方炸開，將破片灑向一片區域。對裝甲效果差。</FT_Gun_TurretAA.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>
  
