  <!-- EN: armor-piercing -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>穿甲彈</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.label>
  <!-- EN: Heavy solid shot that punches through the thickest armor. Small blast. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>能貫穿最厚裝甲的重型實心彈，爆炸範圍小。</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.0.description>
  <!-- EN: high-explosive -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>高爆彈</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.label>
  <!-- EN: Heavy high-explosive shell. Low penetration, wide concussive blast. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>重型高爆彈。穿透力低，震盪爆炸範圍大。</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.1.description>
  <!-- EN: smoke -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>煙霧彈</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.label>
  <!-- EN: Lays a smoke screen at the target. Does no damage. -->
  <FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>在目標處施放煙幕，不造成傷害。</FT_Gun_TurretEmpero.comps.CompAmmoSwitch.ammos.2.description>
  
